#: code:addons/liber_support_soc/wizard/co_from_conversation.py:0
msgid "%(count)s title(s) of the report are still storable goods in the catalogue (marked \"Check!\"): confirming the order opens a delivery for them. Make them ebook/audiobook on the product."
